    "answer": {
      "short": "$6$ or $-6$.",
      "worked": "Let the number be $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+8&=44\\\\x^2&=36\\\\x&=\\pm\\sqrt{36}\\\\x&=\\pm6\\end{align*}$$",
